"The ear hears these on its own, no asking. Pick one and walk: the compass ring closes as you near it, and your steps teach it the way." = "귀는 이것들을 스스로 듣는다, 묻지 않고. 하나를 골라 걸어라: 나침반 고리는 가까워질수록 닫히고, 도착하면 쿵 소리가 문턱을 알린다.";
"The gate stands at every funnel: under a condition, a forbidden organ cannot start — not by hand, not by macro, not by her, not by a saved arm returning at launch. Refusals are journaled. A single payload you fire yourself is you speaking, and is not regulated; everything that stands, advertises, serves, probes or polls is." = "문은 모든 깔때기에 서 있다: 조건 아래에서는 금지된 기관이 시작할 수 없다 — 손으로도, 다른 역학으로도, 녹화된 매크로로도.";
